          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="editorial" aria-labelledby="editorial-title">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="editorial-title">Editorial content</h2>
            <p>Short reads and styling notes to help customers build a more considered wardrobe and home.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="editorial-grid">
          <article class="panel story-card">
            <div class="story-thumb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <h3>How to build a 12-piece travel capsule</h3>
            <p>Use two layers, three bottoms, and one carry system to keep packing light without feeling limited.</p>
            <a class="story-link" href="#newsletter">Read the guide</a>
          </article>

          <article class="panel story-card">
            <div class="story-thumb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <h3>Five textures that make a room feel finished</h3>
            <p>Mix matte ceramics, brushed cotton, and warm wood tones for a space that feels balanced.</p>
            <a class="story-link" href="#newsletter">Explore the edit</a>
          </article>

          <article class="panel story-card">
            <div class="story-thumb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <h3>The color palette behind this season’s bestsellers</h3>
